params.text:
{{-
[
  {
    "label": contact.properties.discord_username ~ " (" ~ contact.properties.email ~ ")",
    "id": contact.properties.discord_username ~ "," ~ contact.properties.discord_id
  }
  for contact in CTX.filtered_contact_output
  if contact.properties.discord_username and contact.properties.discord_id and contact.properties.discord_id != "Not Found"
]
-}}

schema.text:
**Account Details:**

---

**Company Name:** {{ CTX.company.label.split(",")|first }}

**Company Domain & Server:** {{ CTX.company.value }}

**Discord Username & Email:** {{ CTX.discord_user.label }}

---

---
**Allowed Roles:** {{ [role.label for role in CTX.hubspot_check]|join(", ") }}

**Missing Roles:** {{ [role.label for role in CTX.missing_roles]|d(["None"])|join(", ") }}

---

